\
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec12 with\cf2 \cb3 \strokec9  torch\cf2 \cb3 \strokec10 .\cf2 \cb3 \strokec9 no_grad\cf2 \cb3 \strokec10 ():\cf2 \cb3 \strokec9 \
